# Users are created by infra/pi/setup.sh (mosquitto_passwd). Topic structure: docs/contract.md.

# the brain (M1) and the simulator/CLI tools may do everything under vega/
user brain
topic readwrite vega/#

# the dashboard: read everything, and send commands. Nothing else.
user ui
topic read vega/#
topic write vega/system/command

# ESP devices: report their own topics and receive commands. (Per-device users and ACLs arrive with M2.)
user device
topic write vega/+/+/state
topic write vega/+/+/meta
topic write vega/+/+/availability
topic read vega/+/+/set
